       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9d562d2fdef1ff58e3053e0ce6aca296?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FNR-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9d562d2fdef1ff58e3053e0ce6aca296?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FNR-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Nick Ruest",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Afe14f014-ccfb-4882-b081-85802f8c5346",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a>, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" data-account-id=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" accountid=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Unknown</a> would it be possible to devote some time to this on tomorrow's call? I've been thinking about this <b>a lot</b>. But, I keep on coming back to what exactly the use case(s) is/are, and I figure it might be better to talk it out a bit.</p>",
     "created": "03/Nov/15 9:37 PM",
     "id": "15719",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11740/comment/15719",
     "updateAuthor": {
